{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nasi Tuna adalah sebuah VN yang konyol dan kecil tentang sesuatu yang hangat dan lembut yaitu... nasi tuna \ud83d\udc1f\ud83c\udf5a!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3035620/extras/45a0a22d343d062f3022344742494687.avif?t=1760561178\" width=280 height=291 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >p. Apakah dia menaruh mayones di nasi tunanya?<br>j. Tidak, dia benci mayones.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3035620/extras/3aab5f4dc173188de922b42af7ca1d6a.avif?t=1760561178\" width=280 height=280 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">&quot;Mayones-- Kamu bercanda apa?&quot;</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fitur-Fitur</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    1,000 kata (waktu baca sekitar 10 menit)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Visual novel linier tanpa adanya pilihan atau cabang</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gambar orisinil</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    Persahabatan yang hangat! </p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Kredit</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    cerita, seni, pemrograman: Konayachi</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    suara hujan: freesfx.co.uk</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    pengoreksi teks: S.B.Hunter </p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Penerjemah</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bahasa Indonesia: namoniya</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >French: Hugo Lorenzini</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Italiano: Mei Setzu</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Portugu\u00eas do Brasil: Ony</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aku sangat senang membuat VN ini! Terima kasih telah membaca!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game ini dibuat untuk O2A2 VN Jam 2023, sebuah Visual Novel jam mikro dengan limitasi asset yang ketat dan batasan 1000 kata.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3035620?t=1760561178","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3035620/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1760561178","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3035620/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760561178","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3035620/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760561178","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nasi Tuna adalah sebuah VN yang konyol dan kecil tentang sesuatu yang hangat dan lembut yaitu... nasi tuna \ud83d\udc1f\ud83c\udf5a!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3035620/extras/45a0a22d343d062f3022344742494687.avif?t=1760561178\" width=280 height=291 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >p. Apakah dia menaruh mayones di nasi tunanya?<br>j. Tidak, dia benci mayones.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3035620/extras/3aab5f4dc173188de922b42af7ca1d6a.avif?t=1760561178\" width=280 height=280 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">&quot;Mayones-- Kamu bercanda apa?&quot;</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fitur-Fitur</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    1,000 kata (waktu baca